# The build context is `docker/`, and it should contain nothing but the Dockerfile, the
# files it copies, and the binary `scripts/docker-context.py` puts there. Anything else
# would be a cache-busting surprise or, worse, something shipped by accident.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!cbox-init.yaml
!telemetryd-linux-amd64
!telemetryd-linux-arm64
